# Kaveh Xingqiu Fischl Kuki. ~21s Rot. Kaveh Hyperbloom. Kaveh needs Fav for ER purposes. Xingqiu 3EM > ADC; Xingqiu owns a meanigful amount of Bloom and EC. Fischl and Kuki alternate skill/burst to fill rotation time for Xingqiu's skill.

# Team
